{"code":0,"data":{"job_post_detail":{"id":"7670890904535009582","title":"AI终端产品经理（整机）","description":"1、负责手机、平板、PC、配件等AI终端的整机产品规划与定义，洞察用户需求、AI终端趋势及市场竞品情况，输出产品定位、核心卖点、产品组合与上市节奏。\n2、推动软硬协同，与ID、硬件、OS、芯片、算法、供应链等团队协作，把端侧AI能力落地为可量产、可体验、可卖爆的整机产品。\n3、跟进产品全生命周期，从立项、研发、测试、上市到首销复盘，对产品体验和商业结果负责。\n4、参与人车家全生态协同，定义手机、Pad、PC与汽车、AIoT之间的跨设备AI体验。","requirement":"1、本科及以上，专业不限，理工、设计、商科均可。\n2、对AI和消费电子有强兴趣，关注消费电子品类市场行业趋势，端侧A、大模型等AI相关行业趋势。\n3、具有极佳的沟通能力、跨团队推动力、逻辑能力和产品设计能力。\n4、对数据敏感,具备较强分析加工能力。","recruit_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"publish_time":1786018689014,"channel_online_status":1,"job_subject":{"id":"7659311908839262514","name":{"zh_cn":"2027届校园招聘计划","i18n":"2027届校园招聘计划"},"limit_count":2,"active_status":1},"job_function":{"id":"7178035552473448557","name":"产品类","en_name":"Product","i18n_name":"产品类"},"job_id":"7670890904534878510","city_list":[{"code":"CT_11","name":"北京","en_name":"Beijing","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"北京","py_name":"beijing","mdm_code":"MDCY00000001","node_status":1}],"job_post_info":{"recruitment_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"HighlightList":[],"JobChannelPublishList":[],"job_post_object_value_map":{},"address_list":[],"city_list":[],"correlation_job_list":[],"tag_list":[],"storefront_list":[],"target_major_list":[],"job_post_process_time_list":[],"job_level_id_list":[]},"city_info_list_for_delivery":[{"code":"CT_11","name":"北京","en_name":"Beijing","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"北京","py_name":"beijing","mdm_code":"MDCY00000001","node_status":1}],"tag_list":[],"storefront_mode":1,"storefront_list":[],"process_type":2},"re